	(text "This sheet is an empty, valid scaffold. Capture the design from\nhardware/DESIGN.md (block diagram, power tree, net list, pin map).\nBlocks to draw:\n  1. USB-C receptacle + CC 5.1k + ESD\n  2. MCP73831 Li charger + status LED + PROG resistor\n  3. Load-share: DMG2305UX P-FET + Schottky (USB priority)\n  4. AP2112K-3.3 LDO -> +3V3\n  5. ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 + decoupling + EN/BOOT + buttons\n  6. E-Paper GDEY0426T82 (SSD1677) 24-pin FPC + DC-DC (L2/Q2/D4-6, DESIGN.md 5)\n  7. Frontlight: 6-pin FPC + 2x TPS61165 boost (cold/warm)\n  8. microSD (SPI) [optional]\n  9. Battery sense divider -> ADC\nRun ERC after capture, then update DESIGN.md section 11."
